 { The experience of training this course will be slightly different from studying the physical book. The Chessable team have worked together with the author to determine the optimal key-moves for every exercise. This means you will not be asked to find every move shown in every exercise. Rather, you will solve all the necessary moves to optimally digest the relevant positional theme. We exclude moves that are random, un-forcing, irrelevant to the positional theme, and are designed simply to show the game continuation. This way, we minimize any frustration that may arise from being asked to solve too many moves not germane to the theme. When you finish a puzzle, often there will be additional moves and analysis which we recommend you study to maximize your learning. We hope you appreciate this approach and your learning experience is optimized as a result. Chessable Team }  
 *
